                    %mo ′
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} U'
          %p
            If one does not accept the
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/axiom+of+choice"} axiom of choice
            %em property
            (for example, having all
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/product"} products
            %em structure
            realising that property (in the example, a functor taking each pair
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi x
                  %mo ,
                  %mi y
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (x,y)
            of objects to a specific product cone
            = succeed ")." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi x
